  "result": "`JSON.rawJSON` now runs ParseJSON and creates the frozen `rawJSON` object. `./t262 built-ins/JSON/rawJSON/` gives 16 passing and 4 failing (up from 12 passing on main), and clippy is clean.\n\nStep 5 calls the `pub(crate)` `parse` (JSON.parse) entry in `json/parse.rs` rather than the private `parse_json`, since it returns the unfiltered value when there is no reviver. The `parse_json` visibility change would have needed an edit outside my scope. The `BigInt` not-implemented error from the attempt-411 run is gone, and the remaining 4 failures are all `JSON.stringify` not serialising `[[IsRawJSON]]` objects.\n\nBLOCKED: JSON.stringify must check [[IsRawJSON]] and emit the `rawJSON` text (SerializeJSONProperty step 4.a) in json/stringify.rs, which is outside this ticket's file scope; this is what the remaining basic.js and bigint-raw-json-can-be-stringified.js failures need.",
